<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #DCE6F5">We are interested in establishing direct purchasing relationships with manufacturers and suppliers throughout the United States of America.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #DCE6F5">We seek long-term commercial relationships based on reliability, competitive pricing and mutual growth.</p>
