<li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 17px; color: #FFFFFF"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="#8FC1FF" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9"></path></svg>New products</li><li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 17px; color: #FFFFFF"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="#8FC1FF" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9"></path></svg>Wholesale pricing</li><li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 17px; color: #FFFFFF"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="#8FC1FF" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9"></path></svg>Availability</li><li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 17px; color: #FFFFFF"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="#8FC1FF" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9"></path></svg>Purchasing conditions</li><li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 17px; color: #FFFFFF"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="#8FC1FF" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9"></path></svg>Export possibilities</li>
</ul>
<div style="padding-top: 12px"><a href="#contact" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 0 26px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FFFFFF; color: #0E2F6B">Present your products</a></div>
</div>
