<p style="margin: 0; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #0B5FC4">Our mission</p>
<p class="mission" style="margin: 0; max-width: 920px; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.4; color: #0E2F6B">To expand the international commercialization of U.S.A. manufactured products through direct purchasing, resale and export operations, connecting American production with growing markets in Argentina and South America.</p>
